!static/
!static/gowise/
!static/gowise/**
# Large / local-only data not used by the API process
data/raw
data/processed
data/mobility_network/**/gtfs
data/mobility_network/**/*.zip
data/mobility_network/**/failed
.tmp_bmrcl_gtfs
.tmp_bmtc_gtfs

# Docs / misc
README.md
*.md
!data/mobility_network/**/README.md
